# Nordfjord and Jølster, the gap between the Sogn and Sunnmøre–Romsdal
# boxes: Ålfotbreen, Sandane and Utvik, Olden, Loen (Skåla, Lodalen,
# Kjenndalen) and Stryn, Hornindal, Jølster from Vassenden to Skei, and
# the north side of Jostedalsbreen, east to Strynefjellet and Geiranger,
# where it overlaps Breheimen. Much of it is fjord and glacier. No
# official boundary, so a box around Kartverket's place names. EPSG:25833
# metres, on the 2 km tile grid (1581 tiles).
WEST=4000
SOUTH=6850000
EAST=106000
NORTH=6912000
# N50 county files covering the box (Kartverket names), for the no-go areas.
N50_COUNTIES="46_Vestland 15_More_og_Romsdal 34_Innlandet"
